    "# 🔍 Data Quality Assurance: Trust But Verify\n",
    "\n",
    "## The Foundation of Reliable Analytics\n",
    "\n",
    "**\"Garbage in, garbage out\" — the oldest rule in data science.** Before we make million-dollar decisions based on our analysis, we need to ensure our data is clean, complete, and trustworthy.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🎓 Why Data Quality Matters (Especially in Music Industry Analytics):\n",
    "\n",
    "**For Data Science Students:**\n",
    "- **Statistical Validity**: Bad data leads to wrong conclusions\n",
    "- **Model Performance**: ML models are only as good as their training data\n",
    "- **Business Impact**: Incorrect insights can waste marketing budgets\n",
    "\n",
    "**For Music Industry Executives:**\n",
    "- **Investment Decisions**: Ensure recommendations are based on accurate data\n",
    "- **Artist Relations**: Avoid unfair comparisons due to data inconsistencies\n",
    "- **Regulatory Compliance**: Accurate reporting for royalties and contracts\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔍 Our Data Quality Framework:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **📊 Completeness**: Are we missing critical data points?\n",
    "2. **🎯 Accuracy**: Do the numbers make sense?\n",
    "3. **🔗 Consistency**: Are relationships between data points logical?\n",
    "4. **⏰ Timeliness**: Is our data current and relevant?\n",
    "5. **🎵 Uniqueness**: Are we double-counting anything?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
