    "## 🛠️ Data Cleaning & Remediation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Automated Data Quality Improvements\n",
    "\n",
    "**Now that we've identified issues, let's implement systematic fixes to improve data quality.**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 🎯 Cleaning Strategy:\n",
    "1. **🔄 Deduplication**: Remove or merge duplicate records\n",
    "2. **📊 Outlier Treatment**: Flag extreme values for review\n",
    "3. **🔗 Relationship Repair**: Fix orphaned records where possible\n",
    "4. **📝 Standardization**: Ensure consistent formatting\n",
    "5. **⚠️ Flagging**: Mark suspicious data for manual review"
   ]
  },
